13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,30,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.1,0,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: HorribleSubsScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:44.08,Captions,,50,0,0,,Cacao IslandDialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:45.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew's...Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:49.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,planned rendevouz at Cacao Island is in 32 minutes.Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:50.95,Captions,,40,0,0,,12:28 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody has come out yet. I guess the battle is dragging on.Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:55.26,Title,,0,0,250,,One Last ThingDialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:58.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there any chance that Big Brother Katakuri might lose?Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:01.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You think there's a chance that Katakuri might lose?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:04.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Newji! Are you...Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,serious?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The chance of that is zero!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you hit me?! I'm Newsan! I wasn't the one who said that!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri will never be defeated for the rest of his life!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.83,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri is a perfect man!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! I'm Newshi!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Newsan, Newshi...Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what you get!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:37.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:39.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool! You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,But... he hasn't contacted us in a while... It's strange.Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If I were Straw Hat, here's what I would do:Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:50.40,Main,,0,0,0,,he is planning to rendezvous with his crew  at 1 a.m., here on Cacao Island.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:56.37,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, his crew won't arrive until 1 a.m...Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:03:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If I were in his shoes, I'd capture Sister Brûlée, the only key to the Mirro-world...Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,and wait out the clock in the Mirro-world or on other islands!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That makes sense! Sister Brûlée is currently missing, after all!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's highly likely that Straw Hat Luffy will try and run away from his duel with Katakuri...Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:21.87,Main,,0,0,0,,and come out of this mirror at 1 a.m. sharp...Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I see... I agree.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Brûlée is a bit dense, so she's easy to capture.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Akimeg, our sister might be listening through the mirror.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, oops!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got 30 minutes... We need to stay alert.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and come out, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll chop you in half with my sickle!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:03.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Are they all fighters?Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:07.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Seems like that's the only mirror that they left intact...Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,When Luffy comes out, we need to leave immediately...Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:17.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,or both of us will be killed...Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,When Luffy comes out, that'll be when we part ways...Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-cha...Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So far away!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:33.61,Main,,0,0,0,,D-D-D... Don't look at me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:35.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I am listening to you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:37.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,san!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:45.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Looking back, we sure met in unusual circumstances...Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:56.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is your bride-to-be... Charlotte Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:59.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's get married tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:07.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun with you, Pudding-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,but it's almost time for us to say goodbye.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:11.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:24.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I fooled you and tried to kill you...Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So don't thank me, Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:30.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I want to apologize!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I really need to apologize!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:01.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No! No! I did it again!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! We're enemies, after all!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:09.43,Main,,0,0,0,,To you, Pudding-chan, our marriage was just a trap.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole thing was staged by the Big Mom Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:21.71,Main,,0,0,0,,maybe it was unpleasant for you, Pudding-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:28.64,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad that you were the one to act as my fiancée, Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, no...Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:46.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I didn't mean to insult you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:49.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No! Stop crying!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:50.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Stop, tears!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:52.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean that, Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,san...Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you do me a favor?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:09.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Just one last thing...Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This is all I want to ask!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:33.95,Captions,,40,0,0,,12:37 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:43.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I cant believe they survived this long!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:46.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,12:40 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If they're able to escape from such an all-out attack formation...Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll be unbelievable big news!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:58.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Morgans! You won't be getting a scoop!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.31,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to ensure we avoid that...Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,we swallowed our pride and sent a lot of soldiers to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if Gold Roger, the former Pirate King, were to come out of the mirror...Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't be able to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:17.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we catch them all, we'll execute them and line their heads up for display...Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:20.35,Main,,0,0,0,,and you can put that on the front page tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll serve as a warning!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,How vulgar... There's no need to go that far.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly! It's almost too kind!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get good news soon!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way that one ship can get through our gigantic fleet!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:45.27,Captions,,25,0,0,,12:43 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:52.72,Captions,,35,0,0,,At Sea - Bege's ShipDialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The sails are on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Put it out now! We're gonna sink!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't go on-rero, Father! This is the end-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die before we reach the island-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's throw the cake off and flee, Father!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:12.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't falter now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:13.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We may have all come from different places...Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,but in the face of death...Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,we should stick together!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I see it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.26,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Puffs Island!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We're almost there! Stay strong, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:48.90,Captions,,30,0,0,,12:45 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We should be able to make it there by 1 a.m., as we promised!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,But what I'm worried about is the key to escaping the Mirro-world, Brûlée.Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:04.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if Luffy wins, he can't get out of there without Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think Luffy is the type of person that can think that far ahead...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! He can't!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He definitely can't! What should we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.64,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, we don't even know if he knows the current time...Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That too?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:20.72,Main,,0,0,0,,So much could go wrong...Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,but we believe in you, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:30.01,Captions,,0,240,0,,12:47 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:57.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when he falls, he falls forward...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:14.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,At the earliest, we'll arrive in 10 hours!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,At around 1 a.m.!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:22.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So after you beat that guy up...Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:25.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,search for a mirror that leads to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll meet you there!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What time is it right now?Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Someday... will you...Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:09.41,Main,,0,0,0,,come back here to defeat Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! I am...Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:18.68,Main,,0,0,0,,the man who will be the King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You're seeing pretty far into the future...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Branch... Let's go...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Branch?Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,She escaped!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I can't get out of here without her...Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What should I do?Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time...Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:58.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Branch!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The name's Brûlée, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:07.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What foul tricks did you use to take down my big brother?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,So you were able to defeat Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You're...Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:19.30,Main,,0,0,1,,I am Nazoms!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.73,Note,,0,0,0,,Nazo: MysteriousDialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:20.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Mysterious Savior - NazomsDialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to help you escape from here, I captured Brûlée and have been waiting for you!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.41,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're okay...Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Mysterious Savior - NazomsDialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:32.31,Pekoms - Infobox,,100,0,25,,PekomsDialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Big Bro Pedro sacrificed himself to save your lives!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,So I can't let you die here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:45.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat! Let's go meet your friends at Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:51.03,Captions,,30,0,0,,12:50 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There it is! Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:15:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,How many are there?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:03.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a massive fleet!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun! How is it over there?Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy hasn't come out yet.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get close to the fleet at the shore.Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to get Luffy to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.27,Captions,,35,0,0,,12:55 a.m.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Does everyone have their weapons ready?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.37,0:16:32.57,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's gonna come out, it'll be in five minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Now... come on out...Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Four minutes to go...Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat crew's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like they saw us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.81,Main,,0,0,0,,How could they assemble that many ships?Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sink Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We're gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep our distance from the island!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.69,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Smoothie?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll continue to reinforce the back side! They have nowhere to run.Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The Totto Land Grand Fleet led by Snack is ahead of themDialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:59.34,Map,,0,800,360,,Plaza with the MirrorDialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:59.34,Map,,650,0,420,,The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:59.34,Map,,610,0,170,,Smoothie's FleetDialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,and our fleet is behind them.Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if they somehow make it to Cacao Island...Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Oven's army is waiting for them.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They're already cornered rats.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,This is their final destination!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:18.98,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:18.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Link the Transponder Snails!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:22.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We need information from all angles.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Certainly, Mont d'Or-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:27.11,Captions,,980,0,320,,Cacao IslandDialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, you brat!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:34.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:56.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Sulong?Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:06.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We Minks can transform into our primal form by looking at the full moon!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,But I've always had trouble controlling it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,,When I turn Sulong, I'm nothing but a rampaging monster.Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,A monster?Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll run wild and destroy everything around me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:24.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's voice can reach me, except...Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,for one person!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:30.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That person was Big Bro Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:49.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,For some reason, big bro's voice was the only one that could calm me down in that mindless state!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro...Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,So there's no one left in this world who can stop my rampage!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Straw Hat. It's the full moon tonight!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,When I go out to Cacao Island through the mirror,Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll transform into my Sulong form!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:33.65,Main,,0,0,0,,When I go out of control, that'll be your chance to escape from Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.65,0:20:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! It's no use, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn traitor!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:42.22,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a force at Cacao Island large enough to launch a war!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you transform, they'll take you down instantly and it'll be over!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:59.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Pedro sacrificed himself!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.47,0:21:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what, don't let it go to waste! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, do your job for us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:19.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's coming from inside the mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:31.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Sister Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as we thought, she was captured by Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,He's coming! Take aim and fire!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Nazoms!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms! Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.71,0:22:24.61,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't move, Big Mom Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.61,0:22:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I-If you do something stupid...Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll blow your precious sister Brûlée's brains out! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:34.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.37,0:22:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms, what are you thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you calm down?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.94,0:22:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of Sister Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Help! Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:53.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My identity was going to be revealed by going Sulong anyways...Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,so it doesn't matter now!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:11.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll keep Straw Hat alive!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:16.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's the man that Big Bro Pedro bet his life on!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,He's trying to turn Sulong!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.83,0:23:35.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.61,0:23:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to control yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,No!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.13,0:23:44.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold him down!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:46.72,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too late...Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.72,0:23:48.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.85,0:23:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's going on here?Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:24:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither Katakuri nor Straw Hat came out of the mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.27,0:24:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you point a gun at my sister...Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,for no reason?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.16,0:24:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.68,0:24:14.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Heat...Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Wind Fist!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:35.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:43.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:53.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.03,0:24:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.21,0:24:56.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,made it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.75,0:25:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.72,0:25:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.01,0:25:10.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms was hiding him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Get him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.05,0:25:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,He somehow was able to outwit Big Brother Katakuri and escape.Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.70,0:25:17.68,Main,,0,0,0,,That's pretty impressive!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go first!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.97,0:25:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Look up!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You should know...Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.74,0:25:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,that jumping makes you an easy target!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.83,0:25:37.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Just surrender!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.30,0:25:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Raisin!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.50,0:25:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.92,0:25:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you win?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.17,0:25:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.18,0:25:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to escape through the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.89,0:26:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,How naive...Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.20,0:26:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We were prepared for this!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.10,0:26:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We can use Moonwalk, too!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,One!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.53,0:26:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Two!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.61,0:26:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Three!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.78,0:26:11.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Four!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.95,0:26:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Five!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Make it so he'll never see the full moon again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.42,0:26:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Not paying attention....Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.80,0:26:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,is disrespectful-yu!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:10.39,Main,,0,0,0,,When you're vastly outnumbered, it's meaningless...Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.39,0:27:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,no matter how hard you struggle.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.77,0:27:16.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.13,0:27:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:24.50,Main,,0,0,0,,There was an explosion at the harbor!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.34,0:27:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened-nie?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.48,0:27:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The ships by the coast are burning!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.01,0:27:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.56,0:27:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Was there a bomb?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.74,0:27:40.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a fleet, Snack-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.47,0:27:42.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.01,0:27:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's...Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:45.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa's fleet!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.44,0:27:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to have been wiped out hours ago!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Next, prepare to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:56.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa 66!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.72,0:27:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.28,0:28:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.36,0:28:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking care of us at the Tea Party...Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.29,0:28:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa 66!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.49,0:28:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys here?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:46.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We also wanted a chance...Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,to shake things up!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:56.32,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll  Pekoms Injury Fix: KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:07.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,We'veDialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:07.54,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gotDialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:07.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SuDialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDia